<title>TANZANIA: Tanzania shilling ends week weaker against dollar.</title>
<headline>Tanzania shilling ends week weaker against dollar.</headline>
<dateline>DAR ES SALAAM 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tanzania shilling ended the week slightly weaker against the dollar on Friday, the central bank said.</p>
<p>The shilling traded at a mean commerical rate of 598.9401 compared to 598.9302 on Thursday and 598.0689 last Friday.</p>
<p>Against the pound, the shilling traded at a commerical mean rate of 980.5878 compared with 984.3448 on Thursday.</p>
